   - `fact-sim-ai` `engine_test` run with `action="run"`, `engines=["event-fast-worker","event-fast-par"]`, `examples=["simple","sample_line1"]`, `reruns=0`, `strictFinalParity=false`, `targetSimMs=3000`, `maxWallMs=1500`: `PASS`, 9/9 cases, no failures.

